			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "84e0c7be-d1ad-4e6f-9449-07fb6de7c1f3")
	)
	(text "DESIGN NOTES:\n1. Board distributes regulated 5 V power for one panel column (six branches of 56 LEDs).\n2. F1 is a 7.5 A replaceable input fuse; F2-F7 are 1.5 A hold resettable branch protectors.\n3. C1/C2/C3 provide complementary bulk, mid-frequency, and high-frequency bypassing.\n4. Each YYZ_PIXEL chain also provides local bulk and IC decoupling at its load.\n5. Use 2 oz copper, broad +5V/GND pours, short high-current paths, and 2.0 mm FR-4.\n6. Verify every connector polarity against the actual harness before assembly.\n7. Board outline is 140 mm x 50 mm; confirm hinge and cable clearance before fabrication.\n8. LED1 indicates that fused 5 V power is present; it is not a safe-to-service interlock."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.162 128.778 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(thickness 0.3556)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a1f9bc48-d952-4af8-823c-4e1b9847f81b")
	)
